Phase 4c-b changes covered:
  - cropwofost_config_t: full WOFOST type-2 config with 21 sub-tables
    (preparation, sowing, germination, harvest, crop_factor, phenology,
    initial, green_area, assimilation, conversion, respiration,
    partitioning, death, root, oxygen_stress, drought_stress, salinity,
    compensate, interception, co2, management) and per-sub-table
    validators wired into top-level validate
  - read_cropwofost_toml: TOML reader for type-2 .crp.toml; AFGEN tables
    encoded as arrays of arrays decoded into 2-D real(real64) arrays
  - read_crop_toml: dispatch on [[crop.rotation]].type=2 to invoke
    read_cropwofost_toml against the loaded sub-document
  - Parity tests:
    - hupselbrook potatod (case 1) full-config parity (Task 8)
    - salinitystress (case 5) full-config parity (Task 12)
  - legacy_crop_helper: shared infra for driving legacy readcropfixed/
    readcropwofost/readgrass under tests; fixed/grass wrappers (Tasks 7, 13)
  - 4c-a parity tests tightened to use the legacy-reader-driven helper
    instead of literal-value assertions (Tasks 14a-14d)
  - readswap state reset between parity-test invocations (test infra fix)

